                            <item name="AllowTreeAccess" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">true</item>
                            <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Number for the thermal conductance of the frame material measured
from inside to outside of the frame surface (no air films) and taking
2D conduction effects into account [W/m2-K]. Values for typical frame
materials are as follows.
* Aluminum with Thermal Break - 56.4 W/m2-K
* Aluminum One-Sided (Flush) - 10.7 W/m2-K
* Wood - 3.5 W/m2-K
* Vinyl - 2.3 W/m2-K</item>
                            <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">f6b5e2a1-c1c8-4eb2-aac4-0319e763bdbf</item>
