                <item name="GUID" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">59e0b89a-e487-49f8-bab8-b5bab16be14c</item>
                <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item>
              </items>
              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="8">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A panel for custom notes and text values</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">abf164e7-ace6-4b2d-ad6b-68022b5e56cb</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item>
                    <item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="ScrollRatio" type_name="gh_double" type_code="6">0</item>
                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">NATURAL VENTILATION CONTROL (HB Ventilation Control)
Windows open only when:
  Indoor temp.  22–25 °C
  Outdoor temp. 15–30 °C

Logic: window opening driven by indoor/outdoor temperature
during occupancy, following the window-control strategy of
Neves et al. (2025), who open windows when operative temperature
exceeds the ASHRAE 55-2020 adaptive comfort limit.
  Building and Environment, doi:10.1016/j.buildenv.2025.113330

Assumption (thresholds): indoor band 22–25 °C lies between the
heating (20 °C) and cooling (26 °C) setpoints, so natural
ventilation is used before mechanical cooling starts. Outdoor
limits 15–30 °C avoid cold draughts and hot-air intake.</item>
                  </items>
                  <chunks count="2">
                    <chunk name="Attributes">
                      <items count="5">
                        <item name="Bounds" type_name="gh_drawing_rectanglef" type_code="35">
